---
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-12 sm:py-20 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-indigo-50/50 to-transparent">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center relative z-10">
    <span class="inline-block text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase bg-indigo-50/90 border border-indigo-100/60 px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-sm">
      Imprenta & Papelería Creativa
    </span>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-normal text-indigo-950 mt-4 sm:mt-6 leading-tight tracking-tight">
      Imprimimos las ideas que <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="italic font-serif text-indigo-600">orbitan</span> en tu cabeza.
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-4 sm:mt-6 text-sm sm:text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto font-light leading-relaxed">
      Hacemos real lo que imaginas. Papelería y soluciones de impresión con terminaciones mágicas para marcas, eventos y personas.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 sm:mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto pt-2">
      <a href="#marcas" class="paper-card-wrapper paper-rotate-left block group">
        <div class="paper-card p-5 sm:p-6 bg-white transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1.5 active:scale-98 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[140px] sm:min-h-[160px]">
          <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl block mb-2 sm:mb-3 transform transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" aria-hidden="true">🚀</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-medium text-indigo-950 text-base sm:text-lg leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">
            Quiero potenciar mi marca
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-light leading-relaxed">
            Packaging, stickers y tarjetas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>
      
      <a href="#eventos" class="paper-card-wrapper paper-rotate-right block group">
        <div class="paper-card p-5 sm:p-6 bg-white transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1.5 active:scale-98 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[140px] sm:min-h-[160px]">
          <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl block mb-2 sm:mb-3 transform transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" aria-hidden="true">✨</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-medium text-indigo-950 text-base sm:text-lg leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">
            Tengo un evento especial
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-light leading-relaxed">
            Invitaciones, tags y cartelería.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="#tienda" class="paper-card-wrapper paper-rotate-center block group">
        <div class="paper-card p-5 sm:p-6 bg-white transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1.5 active:scale-98 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-[140px] sm:min-h-[160px]">
          <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl block mb-2 sm:mb-3 -scale-x-100 inline-block transform transition-transform group-hover:-scale-x-110" aria-hidden="true">🌙</span>
          <h3 class="font-serif font-medium text-indigo-950 text-base sm:text-lg leading-snug group-hover:text-indigo-600 transition-colors">
            Busco papelería para mí
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1 font-light leading-relaxed">
            Cuadernos, agendas y láminas.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .paper-rotate-left {
      transform: rotate(-1.8deg);
    }
    .paper-rotate-right {
      transform: rotate(1.5deg);
    }
    .paper-rotate-center {
      transform: rotate(-0.6deg);
    }
  }

  .paper-card-wrapper {
    will-change: transform, filter;
    filter: 
      drop-shadow(2px 8px 12px rgba(45, 35, 66, 0.08)) 
      drop-shadow(1px 3px 4px rgba(45, 35, 66, 0.05));
    transition: filter 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .paper-card-wrapper:hover {
    filter: 
      drop-shadow(4px 16px 20px rgba(45, 35, 66, 0.14)) 
      drop-shadow(2px 5px 6px rgba(45, 35, 66, 0.08));
  }

  .paper-card {
    clip-path: polygon(
      0% 4px, 8% 0px, 16% 3px, 24% 1px, 32% 4px, 40% 0px, 48% 3px, 56% 1px, 64% 4px, 72% 0px, 80% 3px, 88% 1px, 96% 3px, 100% 1px,
      calc(100% - 2px) 15%, 100% 30%, calc(100% - 3px) 45%, 100% 60%, calc(100% - 2px) 75%, 100% 90%, calc(100% - 1px) 100%,
      92% calc(100% - 3px), 84% 100%, 76% calc(100% - 2px), 68% 100%, 60% calc(100% - 4px), 52% 100%, 44% calc(100% - 2px), 36% 100%, 28% calc(100% - 3px), 20% 100%, 12% calc(100% - 1px), 4% 100%, 0% calc(100% - 2px),
      2px 85%, 0% 70%, 3px 55%, 1px 40%, 3px 25%, 1px 10%
    );
  }
</style>